+*   **Noise in $x_{term}$:** Imperfect geometry reconstruction in the pre-trained NeRF leads to noise in $x_{term}$, requiring regularization via $\mathcal{L}_{offset}$ and $\mathcal{L}_{TV}$ [S1].
